### Get all projects
GET http://localhost:3000/api/projects

### Get one project
GET http://localhost:3000/api/projects/atlas-dashboard

### Get a project that does not exist
GET http://localhost:3000/api/projects/does-not-exist


### Create a contact submission
POST http://localhost:3000/api/contact
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Alex Morgan",
  "email": "alex@example.com",
  "company": "Example Studio",
  "subject": "Website project",
  "message": "I'd like to discuss a new website."
}

